WEBVTT

00:07:28.027 --> 00:07:31.780
Or even murdered like Boris Nemtsov.

00:07:32.698 --> 00:07:33.866
Compromise?

00:07:40.873 --> 00:07:42.082
Not black and white?

00:07:43.959 --> 00:07:45.461
Are you sure?

00:07:45.461 --> 00:07:47.171
Compromise with this?

00:07:48.255 --> 00:07:52.885
You cannot look at the images
from Ukraine in recent weeks

00:07:52.927 --> 00:07:55.012
and say there is no pure evil.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.767
Mariupol destroyed, Bucha slaughtered,

00:07:59.808 --> 00:08:02.895
Kramatorsk train station massacred.